-match-with-georgia-southern-and-uab</guid><category>Rifle</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU Rifle Team in season opening match shooting prone smallbore" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/18/DSC07638.jpg" /><br /><br />STATESBORO, Ga. – The West Virginia University rifle team finished in the middle of a tri-match after falling short of Georgia Southern, 4740-4738, and beating Alabama Birmingham, 4738-4568, on Sunday inside the Shooting Sports Education Center.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/18/DSC07638.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/18/DSC07638.jpg"><media:title>WVU Rifle Team in season opening match shooting prone smallbore</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/18/DSC07638.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:23:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>8</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59559</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Drop Four-Setter to Knights on Sunday Afternoon</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/18/volleyball-mountaineers-drop-four-setter-to-knights-on-sunday-afternoon</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/18/volleyball-mountaineers-drop-four-setter-to-knights-on-sunday-afternoon</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Macie Smith and Alexis Finnvold high five when playing against UCF on Oct. 18" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/18/DTB09275.jpeg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The West Virginia University volleyball team (10-8, 3-5 Big 12) dropped a four-set decision to UCF on S